    "scopes": "External SLT real product has NeZero N and no Boolean-count/N0 result. Direct finite-count factorization and finite real-product transport are authored alternatives. Infinite-iid route has genuine construction/prefix-law gaps. Existing compiled Mathlib scalar leaf is not ASTIS producer.",
